# Phyllanthus Emblica — formatting config.
#
# Delegates to clang-format's built-in Google C++ style so it tracks the
# upstream Google C++ Style Guide (https://google.github.io/styleguide/cppguide.html)
# as the tool is updated, rather than freezing a hand-copied snapshot.
#
# Note: clang-format handles whitespace/layout only. Naming conventions from
# AGENTS.md (member suffix_/_prefix, PascalCase types, etc.) are not enforced
# here — that is clang-tidy's domain.
---
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: Google
# Project builds with C++23; let clang-format parse the latest language features.
Standard: Latest
...
